'' TKO0879, fbc's 17, 205 and 206: a member as a module constructor or destructor must be a
'' public static one. See CheckModCtorMember_ in symbols/collectproc.bas.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/module-ctor-member.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: module-ctor-member.bas(16,1): error TKO0879: 'm1' cannot be a module constructor: it is a method, with a THIS, and only a public static member may be one
'' EXPECT-OUT: module-ctor-member.bas(18,1): error TKO0879: 'm2' cannot be a module destructor
'' EXPECT-OUT: module-ctor-member.bas(20,1): error TKO0879: 'p1' cannot be a module constructor: it is private
'' EXPECT-OUT: module-ctor-member.bas(22,1): error TKO0879: 'p2' cannot be a module destructor: it is protected
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 4
